<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SAO PAULO CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAO PAULO CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Sao Paulo</p>
<p>championship matches played Thursday:</p>
<p> America/S.J.Rio Preto  2    Sao Paulo		 5</p>
<p> Botafogo		   2    Mogi Mirim		1</p>
<p> Guarani		    0    Corinthians	     1</p>
